==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This spell is quite useful at lower levels as the summon has [[damage reduction]].
*The blade has an [[attack bonus (item property)|attack bonus]] equal to half the caster's casting [[ability modifier]]. This is the degree of [[damage reduction]] that the blade can penetrate.
** The ability may sometimes be different than the usual (especially if cast from an item). If the caster has bard or sorcerer levels, [[charisma]] is always used; otherwise if the character has cleric, druid, paladin, or ranger levels, [[wisdom]] is used; otherwise if the caster has wizard levels, [[intelligence]] is used. In the event that the caster has none of these classes, [[strength]] is used.
** There is a technical cap of +20 on the attack bonus, but the practical cap for [[player character]]s is +10 due to the maximum achievable ability score. The minimum bonus is +1.

